# =============================================================================
# prebuilt.sha256 — Pinned SHA-256 checksums for prebuilt DFINITY artifacts
#
# These hashes gate the supply-chain integrity of the prebuilt WASMs/Candid
# files fetched by scripts/fetch-prebuilt.sh and consumed by scripts/setup.sh.
#
# Format: one entry per line, "<sha256>  <basename>" (two-space separator, the
# native `shasum -a 256 -c` format). Lines starting with '#' are comments.
#
# Pinned release tags (keep in sync with fetch-prebuilt.sh):
#   LEDGER_RELEASE  = ledger-suite-icrc-2026-02-02
#   EVM_RPC_VERSION = evm_rpc-v2.8.0
#
# PROVENANCE / RE-VERIFICATION:
#   These hashes were captured from the artifacts already committed in .icp/,
#   which were downloaded from the pinned release tags above. They are the
#   known-good baseline. Before bumping either version pin, re-download the
#   new artifacts and re-verify the fresh hashes against the official DFINITY
#   release notes / SHA256SUMS published for the new tag, then update both the
#   version variables in fetch-prebuilt.sh AND the hashes below.
# =============================================================================

# ICRC-1 ledger (ledger-suite-icrc-2026-02-02)
e2d266d3834cecda2a8be8e87ecc435ebffe1a3ae490cd4a807889967e35927f  icrc1-ledger.wasm.gz
02a42599e3d2036a19dcfa53db04ad5a5271b0bd78ac1a5986b3dd361f33a99c  icrc1-ledger.did

# EVM RPC canister (evm_rpc-v2.8.0)
455fcea61d679848761848db2d99ebb9b66a7cf060de350a4fdc5c680e5292c6  evm_rpc.wasm.gz
11735568b4b4fd80fb0075b6f0ff06c592da1a182d08b786f76de2d1118feedd  evm_rpc.did
